- [test:1386–1400](/Users/Heishing/Desktop/canvas/canvas-learning-system/.claude/worktrees/card-w7-ledger/backend/tests/regression/test_g3_2_review_ledger.py:1386) 把合法旧评分的 `rc=1` 锁成正确。
